= Cooperative Commonwealth Women's Clubs

Unlike other CCF wings, the CCF(SS) does not maintain a women's section. Instead, there are various local women's clubs who gather to discuss social democratic literature and contribute material to the CCF's organ. 

Saskatchewan remains a predominantly socially conservative though not decidedly so. Our support for women issues provides an outlet for the rising Feminist movement no matter our party leadership's indifference. 

- @establish_womens_section: We should establish a CCF(SS) Women's Section!
- @campaign_women: Campaign among Women
- @women_theory: Have them discuss and spread Social Democratic Theory
